Tests capabilities in diagnosing cross-service policy routing, tenant isolation, and safe rollout of changes in a mesh.

## Key Concepts
- Tenant isolation and feature flag governance
- Istio routing via VirtualService and proxy-config
- Envoy-level filters and mesh policy impact
- Canary rollouts and rollback strategies

